      "behavior": "restore-s3.hcl is a parameterized batch job that takes a bucket name, copies gcs:<bucket>/minio/<bucket>/ to seaweedfs:<bucket> with --create-empty-src-dirs --s3-directory-markers, then runs rclone check, then fails if any directory rclone lsf -R --dirs-only lists under the GCS prefix is missing on SeaweedFS, and reads its keys from default/restore-s3/gcs and default/restore-s3/seaweedfs.",
