      "judgment": false
    },
    {
      "id": "r2",
      "behavior": "The applications root creates SeaweedFS user restore with write on the four durable buckets only, and OpenViking's ov.conf.json reads its S3 key from default/openviking/seaweedfs and its endpoint from the renamed S3 endpoint variable.",
